  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarrationSequenceSO
  passages:
  - Up the stairs, we immediately find ourselves in a spacious hallway, called there,
    for some unknown reason, the caida, which tonight serves as the dining-room and
    at the same time affords a place for the orchestra.
